@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+Type aliases
+============
+
+.. py:module:: example
+
+.. py:class:: Target
+
+.. py:type:: Scalar
+   :canonical: int
+
+   An integer alias.
+
+.. py:type:: OptionalScalar
+   :canonical: list[Target]
+
+   A union alias.
+
+.. py:class:: Container
+
+   .. py:type:: Item
+      :canonical: Scalar
+
+      A class scoped alias.
+
+       .. py:class:: NestedFromBody
+
+          This object is not nested under the alias.
+
+   .. py:type:: Bare
+
+      An alias without a canonical expression.
+
+Use :py:type:`Scalar`, :py:type:`OptionalScalar`, :py:type:`Container.Item`,
+and :py:obj:`Scalar`.
